{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sxUOfFGXxr1795478517.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>專注於放射性藥物的先通醫藥，招股獲逾5,200倍超額認購。</p><p></p><p>今日掛牌的先通醫藥，股份公開發售部分錄得逾5,227倍超額認購，一手中籤率百分之1.5。國際發售超購2倍。每股招股價52，集資淨額約2.76億元，主要用於新藥的臨床試驗，及註冊申報資金。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T01:34:26.942606+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T08:37:14.525616+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T01:27:53.155257+00:00","content_hash":"3b63ff1118ca907d17b6629bd7791f2e99e63f49004f435a2142c9deddf7f0c7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T01:34:26.942606+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}